{"story_id":61308,"updated_at":"2026-11-04T22:17:52","headline_en":"Auckland ODI: Anshul Kamboj bowls maiden over in winning performance","headline_hi":"ऑकलैंड वनडे: अंशुल कांबोज ने जीत दिलाने वाले प्रदर्शन में मेडन ओवर फेंका","payload_en":{"story_id":61308,"headline":"Auckland ODI: Anshul Kamboj bowls maiden over in winning performance","counts":{"articles":2,"independent_sources":2,"outlets":2},"has_established":false,"qualified_by":"express","perspective_mode":"none","perspectives":{"–":["Aaj Tak","Times of India"]},"framing":[],"suicide":false,"thread":61308,"parents":[],"children":[{"story_id":61536,"headline":"Virat Kohli hits 13 fours and a six in 74-run innings","at":"2026-11-05T11:50:35"}],"written_at":"2026-11-04T22:17:52","category":{"v":2,"primary":["india"],"secondary":["life"],"tertiary":["sport-films"]},"places":[],"people":["New Zealand","Anshul Kamboj","Auckland","Daryl Mitchell","Glenn Phillips","Anshul Kamboj's","Arshdeep Singh","Blair Tickner"],"narrative":{"paragraphs":[[{"text":"On Wednesday 4 November 2026, Anshul Kamboj played in the first ODI match between India and New Zealand at Eden Park in Auckland.","ids":[100367],"class":"partial","sources":[1,2]}],[{"text":"Kamboj was named Player of the Match for his performance, and he did not bowl a single ball on the middle or leg stump during his spell.","ids":[100368,100376],"class":"single","sources":[1]},{"text":"Kamboj dismissed New Zealand captain Mitchell Santner and Nathan Smith, Arshdeep Singh dismissed Will Young, Henry Nicholls, and Glenn Phillips, and Gurnoor Brar dismissed Tom Latham.","ids":[100387,100388,100389,100392,100390],"class":"single","sources":[2]},{"text":"Daryl Mitchell was run out, and this performance is the lowest runs conceded by an Indian bowler in a full 10-over spell in ODIs since 2016.","ids":[100391,100373],"class":"single","sources":[1,2]},{"text":"Anshul's deliveries were swinging and moving at high speed, Anshul consistently bowled on or outside the off-stump, Kamboj's bowling figures earned him a place in the record books, and Anshul relied on accurate bowling instead of unnecessary experiments.","ids":[100377,100380,100395,100409],"class":"single","sources":[1,2]},{"text":"It was impossible for batters to play shots against Anshul's accurate line and length on the bouncing and seaming Auckland pitch, Shubman Gill is the captain of the Indian team, and unnecessary experiments pressured New Zealand batters.","ids":[100381,100401,100410],"class":"single","sources":[1,2]}],[{"text":"India won the ODI match against New Zealand in Auckland.","ids":[100370],"class":"single","sources":[1]},{"text":"It bowled out New Zealand for 185 runs in 40.2 overs, and finished their innings at 185 runs.","ids":[100385,100407],"class":"single","sources":[2]}],[{"text":"Kamboj, who is 25 years old, bowled 10 overs with figures of 2/22 against New Zealand in Auckland on Wednesday, taking 2 wickets for 22 runs, including 2 maiden overs.","ids":[100384,100371,100394],"class":"single","sources":[1,2]},{"text":"The bowler recorded 2/22 against New Zealand in 2026, delivering 46 dot balls with an economy rate of 2.20.","ids":[100372,100399],"class":"single","sources":[1,2]},{"text":"Tim Seifert scored 38 runs, Daryl Mitchell scored 28 runs, Phillips scored 30 runs, and Blair Tickner scored 34 runs off 23 balls.","ids":[100403,100404,100405,100406],"class":"single","sources":[2]}],[{"text":"India's bowling attack used five bowlers.","ids":[100400],"class":"single","sources":[2]}]],"section_keys":["news","happened","performers","performers","numbers"],"sources":[{"n":1,"url":"https://www.aajtak.in/sports/cricket/story/ind-vs-nz-sunil-gavaskar-lauds-anshul-kamboj-spell-said-in-england-his-speed-was-close-to-127-130-aksp-dskc-2688396-2026-11-04","outlet":"Aaj Tak","title":"कंबोज की खौफनाक गेंदबाजी का क्या है राज? गावस्कर ने कही बड़ी बात","perspective":"–","read":true,"readable":true},{"n":2,"url":"https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/sports/cricket/ind